      "updated": 1727275495776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 9.018115500426186,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "text": "if 0. fails then 4. will fetch the woff2 from the service worker, memory cache, disk cache or fallback to a network fetch\nif 4. fails then fetch with a fallback url (if defined by `EXCALIDRAW_ASSET_PATH`)\nif 4. fails for all fallbacks then return a the last http url instead of a data url\nif 6.-8. fails then fallback to performing subset in the Main Thread (blocking the UI )",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "if 0. fails then 4. will fetch the woff2 from the service worker, memory cache, disk cache or fallback to a network fetch\nif 4. fails then fetch with a fallback url (if defined by `EXCALIDRAW_ASSET_PATH`)\nif 4. fails for all fallbacks then return a the last http url instead of a data url\nif 6.-8. fails then fallback to performing subset in the Main Thread (blocking the UI )",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
